SUMMARY:Camino de Santiago Pilgrimage Information Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Information Meeting with Mother Stacey on the 12-day pilgrimage along the Camino Portuguese Coastal Route\, May 17-28\, 2027. \nThe journey is just over 100 km (64 miles)\, following the ancient path of pilgrims to Santiago de Compostela. \nClick here for more information about the pilgrimage. \nClick here to join the Zoom meeting.
