SUMMARY:Vespers Pride Celebration and Holy Eucharist
DESCRIPTION:Pride Celebration and Holy Eucharist\nSaint James and the Urban Well Celebrate Pride Worship Service will be on the weekend of Lancaster Pride\, Sunday\, June 21st\, at 5:00 PM. This special service will be a heartfelt blend of celebration and reflection\, expressed through inspiring words and music. You are welcome just as you are; join us for this inclusive and joyous occasion! All offerings collected during the service will be donated to organizations that support the work of the LGBTQIA+ communities. In person only. \nVespers will also be held on July 26th and August 23rd.
URL:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/event/vespers-2-2-2/
LOCATION:Saint James Episcopal Church\, 103 North Duke Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Contemplative Meditation,Contemplative Practice,Contemplative Prayer
